{"id":"operation.complete","rel":{"parent":"package.vim","kind":"contains"},"kind":"operation","sources":[],"content":{"responsibility":"First findstart clears pending/base, snapshots source/buffer/changedtick/full Working/current/context/cursor and Query/Acquire Funcrefs; calls Query on deepcopy, requires exact {start,input}, number in [0,cursor.col-1] on UTF8 byte boundary and Unchanged snapshot/callbacks; otherwise echo/-3. Second call consumes pending once, validates native span removal/prefix/cursor/other lines/source/current/context/callbacks, calls ValidateView(Acquire(deepcopy(raw))) then rechecks state; needs exactly one group matching opaque current/context. Items map word(join text by newline), abbr(label), menu(provenance), optional/default info, user_data(handle), dup/equal/empty=1. Stale/error -> [] with scoped echo.","bindings":[{"source":{"repository":"roccho-dev/edits","revision":"b2f068be67be43a5f4507909a37deacf31068f56","path":"packages/vim/surface.vim","gitBlob":"3cfffbe8cebab65f4353337eb05f3fb6a7703079","url":null,"bodyDigest":null,"selector":"def Complete(findstart: number, prefix: string)"},"symbol":"def Complete(findstart: number, prefix: string)","description":"Exact source operation."}],"requiredIds":["required.input","required.candidates","required.current-behavior"],"providedIds":["provided.native"],"input":{"state":"KNOWN","description":"findstart/prefix, source/buffer/tick/full Working/current/context/cursor and bound Funcrefs.","conditions":[],"sources":[],"findingIds":[]},"output":{"state":"KNOWN","description":"Start offset or -3, then mapped menu item list or [].","conditions":[],"sources":[],"findingIds":[]},"error":{"state":"KNOWN","description":"Bad Query -> echo/-3; invalid span/stale/Acquire error -> [] and scoped echo.","conditions":[],"sources":[],"findingIds":[]},"effect":{"state":"KNOWN","description":"One-shot pending/base state; no adopted effect.","conditions":[],"sources":[],"findingIds":[]},"dependencies":[{"targetId":